  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil for the ravioli. Quarter the leek lengthwise and thinly slice the pale stem, discarding any dark green stem (see Kitchen 101). Quarter the zucchini lengthwise and cut into 1cm-thick slices. Roughly chop the tomato. Crush or finely chop 1 garlic clove.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/448719/photos/large/71756_1-8bd96222a8a96c8e259522f65bf77f52.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sauce: Heat 2 tbs olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the leek and garlic, stirring, for 2-3 mins until softened. Add the zucchini, tomato and currants and cook, stirring regularly, for 2-3 mins until the zucchini is just tender. Stir in 1 tsp red wine vinegar. Season with salt and pepper. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/448720/photos/large/71756_2-0f33c3f7a818868ec3808630887d9374.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook ravioli: Cook the ravioli in the pan of boiling water for 3 mins or until al dente. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/448721/photos/large/71756_3-02e315289342fb3029ac8cbfaab0b394.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add ravioli to sauce: Return the leek mixture to medium-low heat, add the ravioli and gently toss to coat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/448722/photos/large/71756_4-76ef7b0290b0b713fb0bc9273b49527b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the ravioli among bowls. Crumble over the feta and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/448723/photos/large/71756_5-59068f54cffc43843838be45e02adb79.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Prior to chopping, give the pale part of the leek a good rinse under running water to remove any hidden dirt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/448724/photos/large/71756_6-54b70b3dd24f87fd40050b82aa311bcb.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
